    new "Seraphina's body trembled softly in my embrace, then her arms wound about my neck, returning my hold with all her strength and love."

    old "Aku percaya padamu, Guest... Aku mempertaruhkan seluruh jiwa dan napasku pada janjimu."
    new "I believe in you, Guest... I stake my very soul and breath upon your vow."

    old "Pimpinlah aku keluar dari kegelapan ini."
